# Only the trusted runner operator receives these fixed native operations.
# Path arguments are data: the helper rejects non-absolute/root/symlink trees.
# Seal/unseal accept exactly a job UUID and a state root; the seal plan is stdin.
@OPERATOR@ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/libexec/motor-runner-permissions physical-chmod owner-rwX -- *, /usr/local/libexec/motor-runner-permissions physical-chmod private-rwX -- *, /usr/local/libexec/motor-runner-permissions seal * *, /usr/local/libexec/motor-runner-permissions unseal * *
